From 208ffad244774af7cf5e6d498e469afad47b922d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 12:51:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD review-completion prompts so reviewed patch-agent
 chats close cleanly

Ask the reviewed patch-agent session for an explicit yes/no after review resolves without findings. A yes answer is consumed by the controller, marks the feature done, and lets terminal adapters hide the completed chat while keeping later typing able to reopen the same session.
